{"id":"vod_sn_37897","vodId":"37897","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"裁断分离之罪恶剪刀","name_cn":"裁断分离之罪恶剪刀","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第13集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/8d9bf2c325683df32487ed113d64caae.jpg"},"summary":"《断裁分离的罪恶之剪》是根据日本漫画家绯键龙彦创作的同名漫画作品所改编的电视动画，于2012年11月22日在“Comic Alive”的官方网站上发表了动画化消息，同日动画官网开启。非常喜欢给女生剪头发的初中生少年灰村切，某天放学回家时走进一栋西式建筑里，在那里他遇到了有着一头美丽的黑色长发少女武者小路祝。小祝的头发由于受到了诅咒，所以自出生以来不管用什么方法都无法剪断。然而，灰村切使用了自己当作护身符随身携带的剪刀成功剪断了小祝的头发。自此，身份是“发之女王”后代的少女与即使身为携带“杀害遗物”的杀人魔子孙但还是想守护这位少女的爱与战斗的故事开始了！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:56:31","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PeckCP3H761/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/98V8HERf0y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VCguzpkYAv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Zk9ukGJ72n1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q87gqGPL9i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UQ0sPiwS2s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A2VGsZVA6F1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Zd31PtD8yv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EzTz2kkGDV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PXuEvDuBvf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vwe75XXA9e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qm9sp0sRzE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nsjhJEQUKw1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:05.251Z"}